$\Rightarrow \triangle {QHT} = \triangle {QHP} \text{ (c.g.c) }$\\
$\Rightarrow \widehat{HQT} = \widehat{HQP} \Rightarrow 90^{\circ} - \widehat{HQT} = 90^{\circ} - \widehat{HQP} \Rightarrow \widehat{FQT} = \widehat{EQP} $ (3)\\
